{'symbol': 'ETR', 'date': '2023-04-26 06:30:00', 'title': 'ENTERGY REPORTS FIRST QUARTER EARNINGS', 'text': 'COMPANY AFFIRMS GUIDANCE AND OUTLOOKS NEW ORLEANS , APRIL 26, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ENTERGY CORPORATION (NYSE: ETR) REPORTED FIRST QUARTER 2023 EARNINGS PER SHARE OF $1.47\xa0ON AN AS-REPORTED BASIS AND $1.14 ON AN ADJUSTED BASIS (NON-GAAP). "WE HAD A PRODUCTIVE START TO THE YEAR WITH STRONG EXECUTION ON IMPORTANT OPERATIONAL AND REGULATORY FRONTS," SAID DREW MARSH, ENTERGY CHAIRMAN AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER.'}